config UNISOC_CACHEDUMP
	tristate "Enable UNISOC cachedump handler"
        depends on SPRD_SYSDUMP && SPRD_DEBUG
	help
	  This option enables Spreatrum cachedump which prepare debug info
	  for u-boot to write into mmc storage after sysdump in userdebug version.
          And use smcc notify sml to save cachedump.
